    <item>
      <title>1.32欧/年！netcup de域名活动限时返场</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2379981</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2379981</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 16:42:01 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/f/c/ffcb6eab8db46eede8bb8c171bfd96d30374ec34.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/AuRBC22drqbqJQZjKLKXZXudWqE.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/f/c/ffcb6eab8db46eede8bb8c171bfd96d30374ec34_2_429x374.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;AuRBC22drqbqJQZjKLKXZXudWqE&quot; width=&quot;429&quot; height=&quot;374&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/f/c/ffcb6eab8db46eede8bb8c171bfd96d30374ec34_2_429x374.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/f/c/ffcb6eab8db46eede8bb8c171bfd96d30374ec34_2_643x561.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/f/c/ffcb6eab8db46eede8bb8c171bfd96d30374ec34.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;253E4E&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;每月0.11欧，年付1.32欧，首次购买额外一次性收取1.68欧。即首年3欧，续费1.32欧/年，折合人民币首年23.4元，续费13.1元/年！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19002807-httpswwwnetcupcomendealshttpswwwnetcupcomendeals-1&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19002807-httpswwwnetcupcomendealshttpswwwnetcupcomendeals-1&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;官方活动传送门：&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.netcup.com/en/deals&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://www.netcup.com/en/deals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;购买流程推荐阅读： &lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/743845#p-6781296-h-5-22&quot;&gt;活动域名注册流程&lt;/a&gt;，下完订单后可以阅读同个帖子的 &lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/743845#p-6781296-h-11&quot;&gt;第三部分：从零开始注册图文全记录&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;本次活动结束时间不定，原因：&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/f/5/3f51fb4f221d2999d8abfca7d87ee360d8be453d.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/929IZ5xlHDYXxj8qqxZKPrQgnw1.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/f/5/3f51fb4f221d2999d8abfca7d87ee360d8be453d_2_550x500.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;929IZ5xlHDYXxj8qqxZKPrQgnw1&quot; width=&quot;550&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/f/5/3f51fb4f221d2999d8abfca7d87ee360d8be453d_2_550x500.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/f/5/3f51fb4f221d2999d8abfca7d87ee360d8be453d_2_825x750.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/f/5/3f51fb4f221d2999d8abfca7d87ee360d8be453d.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;2C2A2C&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
不过以我浅薄的足球知识来看，德国足球还是挺猛的，这次活动的时间应该不会太短。&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;4 个帖子 - 3 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2379981&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
